-- Tests of the Ofek Hadash base agreement's §7
-- (l4/agreements/ofek-hadash/2008-12-25_ofek-hadash_base-agreement/base-agreement-7.l4):
-- the agreement held against the takanon's §1.13, which carries the mother
-- teacher on. They sit beside it and not in it (the client, 2026-10-22:
-- "assertions about a file should sit next to it, not be included in it").

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-7`
IMPORT `takanon-1-13`

§ `בדיקות סעיף 7 להסכם אופק חדש`

§§ `מול סעיף 1.13 לתקנון`

-- §7(ג)'s "עד גיל 14" includes a child of 14, until the fifteenth birthday
-- (convention thresholds.until-time, Interpretation Law §8, which §25(ד) of
-- the Contracts Law applies to a contract). The takanon's §1.13 reads the
-- same words as before the fourteenth birthday: its §1.13.2 keeps the
-- benefit for a mother whose child "מלאו לו 14 שנים אחרי אחד בספטמבר", and
-- §6.17.8 treats "שטרם מלאו לו 14 שנה" as "עד גיל 14" (the convention's
-- exception). A teacher in a full position whose youngest child is 14 on
-- 1 September: the agreement makes her a mother teacher, the takanon does
-- not. The agreement governs (the takanon's own introduction).
`a child of 14 makes a mother teacher under §7(ג) and not under the takanon's §1.13` MEANS
        `a mother teacher` 1 14 `a mother`
    AND (NOT `is a child up to 14 this year` (`a checked child` `own child` 14 14))
#ASSERT `a child of 14 makes a mother teacher under §7(ג) and not under the takanon's §1.13`

-- Below 14 the two agree, and at 15 neither counts the child.
#ASSERT `a mother teacher` 1 13 `a mother` AND `is a child up to 14 this year` (`a checked child` `own child` 13 13)
#ASSERT (NOT `a mother teacher` 1 15 `a mother`) AND (NOT `is a child up to 14 this year` (`a checked child` `own child` 15 15))
